const e5=`For the source mean-zero smooth scheme (1.4), equivalently Psi after exp(-t partial_x^3)=S_t, and t_j=j*tau_s, write f=exp(t_j partial_x^3)u^j and Fsrc_j(t;f)=(1/2)integral_(t_j)^t Bop_s(f,f)ds, Asrc_j(f)=integral_(t_j)^(t_j+tau_s)Bop_s(f,Fsrc_j(s;f))ds. Equations (4.14)–(4.20),(4.22)–(4.23),(5.2) imply exactly exp((t_j+tau_s)partial_x^3)u^(j+1)=f+Fsrc_j(t_j+tau_s;f)+Asrc_j(f)-Rsrc_j(f,f,f). Here Rsrc_j has zero output at k=0 and, for k!=0, coefficient -tau_s/(18*i*k) sum_(a+b+c=k,a+b!=0) exp(-i*t_j*(k^3-a^3-b^3-c^3))*eta_(tau_s)(3*a*b*(a+b),3*k*c*(a+b))*hat f(a)*hat f(b)*hat f(c). This is the remainder in (4.17),(6.1), and is Remainder_(t_j,tau_s) under the displayed identifications. No convergence estimate is part of this identity.`;
