node("N002",`For tau>0 and real alpha,beta, eta_tau=0 if alpha*beta=0; otherwise |eta_tau|<=2 min(|alpha/beta|,|beta/alpha|) and |eta_tau|<=tau min(|alpha|,|beta|). For nonzero integers a+b+c+d=0, with decreasing magnitudes N1>=N2>=N3>=N4, one has N1<=3N2 and, putting A=|ab|,B=|cd|, (1/|d|)min(A/B,B/A)<=3/N3 and |a+b|/max(A,B)<=6/N3.`,["D013","D015"],["tau","alpha","beta","a","b","c","d","N1","N2","N3","N4","A","B"].map(x=>b(x,["a","b","c","d"].includes(x)?"integer":"real as quantified")),["eta","Third","tau","alpha","beta","a","b","c","d","N1","N2","N3","N4","A","B"],"problem.md:127–203.");
