node("N007",`For 0<tau<=1, n>=0, t in [n*tau,(n+1)*tau] and mean-zero w in H^gamma with ||w||_(H^gamma)<=M0, sup_t||Stage_n(t;w)||_(H^agamma)<=C_(M0,gamma)*tau^gamma and sup_t||Stage_n(t;w)||_(H^(1+gamma))<=C_(M0,gamma). Also ||fg||_2<=C_gamma||f||_(H^gamma)||g||_(H^agamma) for all f,g in these spaces, without mean restrictions. All constants are independent of n,tau and support.`,["D003","D004","D016","D021","D022"],["tau","n","t","w","M0","f","g"].map(x=>b(x,["w","f","g"].includes(x)?"periodic function":x==="n"?"nonnegative integer":"real")),["gamma","H","L2","Bop","Stage","agamma","tau","n","t","w","M0","f","g"],"problem.md:347–368; stage exponent and normalization bridge.");
