node("N008",`For any smooth real mean-zero datum and integer L>=1, tau=T/L, the scheme iterates are smooth, real and mean-zero. With D023 on each step, v^(n+1)=f_n+F_n(t_(n+1))+C_n(t_(n+1))-Remainder_(t_n,tau)(f_n,f_n,f_n). Hence V(t_n)=v^n and V(t_(n+1))=v^(n+1), so V is continuous and piecewise smooth on [0,T]. Also Y_n'=Bop_t(f_n,F_n)+(1/2)Bop_t(F_n,F_n)-W_n/tau, Y_n(t_n)=0, and Rres is continuous, piecewise smooth with Rres'= -Bop_t(Y_n,z_n)-(1/2)Bop_t(Y_n,Y_n)-W_n/tau; consequently V'=(1/2)Bop_t(V,V)+Rres' on each step and distributionally globally. All V,Y_n,z_n,Rres and W_n are mean-zero.`,["D005","D011","D014","D016","D021","D023"],[b("L","positive integer"),b("u0","smooth real mean-zero function")],["T","gamma","S","Psi","Remainder","Bop","Stage","Interp","L","u0"],"problem.md:399–431,470–472,501–514.");
